### Login as seeded admin
POST http://localhost:8082/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "admin@example.com",
  "password": "Admin@12345"
}

### Create Ticket
POST http://localhost:8082/api/v1/tickets
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "title": "  Laptop Keyboard Fault  ",
  "description": "Spacebar key is sticking.",
  "category": "Hardware",
  "priority": "HIGH",
  "createdBy": "Lee"
}

### Update Ticket
PUT http://localhost:8082/api/v1/tickets/6a78000f9be8a41b443ff446
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "title": "Laptop Keyboard Fault",
  "description": "Spacebar key replaced and tested.",
  "category": "Hardware",
  "priority": "MEDIUM",
  "status": "CLOSED"
}

###NotFound Error Path
GET http://localhost:8082/api/v1/tickets/invalid-id-999
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}